'''H. Nah ''' (ハイ・エナジー, ''Hai Enajī'', '''High Energy''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

