==Trivia==
*His full name in English is Hy-ee Nah, which is a pun on what he is: a [[wikipedia:Hyena|hyena]].
*His Japanese name, Hai Enajī, is a play on "high energy" and "hyena", which perhaps became the possible inspiration of [[Red EnerG]], after he drank counterfeit [[Catamin]] [C] and became insane.
*He is likely a reference to the hyena [[wikia:lionking:Ed|Ed]] from ''[[wikipedia:The Lion King|The Lion King]]'', who has a similar personality and, like, H. Nah, four hairs on his head. However, while H. Nah says "no" to everyone and prefers to be alone, even knocking back those that approach him, Ed is obedient and unquestioning to his many allies.
*Every H. Nah variant's Japanese description starts with a quote that ends in ellipses.
*On frame 29 of his attack animation, H. Nah's right hind leg fully disconnects from his body. This animation error was not carried over to either of his variants.

